    "name": "VR360 Management API",
    "description": "VR360 Management API collection.\n\nRecommended flow:\n1. Auth > Login - get JWT. The test script stores access_token and refresh_token.\n2. Use Projects > Locations > Tour Versions to prepare data.\n3. Upload panorama images in Media / Scene Assets.\n4. Publish a location in Publishing, then add allowed domains.\n5. Test public/embed access in Public Viewer using Origin or embed_origin.\n\nMost internal APIs require Bearer {{access_token}}. Public Viewer APIs do not require login but check whitelist domain.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
